  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "kmb2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Komodo is sold as an adventure trip, and for most people it is: a shared boat, thirty strangers, a queue on the Padar ridge at sunrise. As a honeymoon that is a strange choice. But the same islands, on a private boat, on the right days, are among the most genuinely dramatic places you can spend a week together in Indonesia. This route builds the trip around two decisions most couples get wrong: chartering rather than joining, and giving yourselves somewhere soft to land afterwards."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Who this trip is for"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Couples who want scenery rather than spa treatments, and who would rather spend the budget on a private boat day than on a bigger room. It suits honeymooners who are comfortable with early starts, small planes and a bit of heat, and who want a trip that does not look like everyone else's."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It is not for you if your idea of a honeymoon is a resort you never leave, if either of you is uneasy on boats, or if you need reliable connectivity. Labuan Bajo is a working harbour town, not a romantic one, and the romance here is entirely in the islands and the water."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb10",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Trip at a glance"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb13",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms11",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Route: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms12",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bali to Labuan Bajo, four nights there, then two nights on a quiet island, then back."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb16",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms14",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Base changes: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms15",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Two, deliberately. Labuan Bajo for the boat days, an island for the decompression."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb19",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms17",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Pace: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms18",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "One hard day, the rest slow. The Padar sunrise is the only alarm clock."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb22",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms20",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Best for: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms21",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Couples who want the private boat, not the shared one."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb24",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms23",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why this route makes sense"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb26",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms25",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Labuan Bajo is the gateway and the accommodation, not the experience. Every hour you spend there is an hour not on the water, so this route front-loads the boat days while you have energy and weather flexibility, then moves you to a quiet island for the end. Doing it the other way round means finishing the honeymoon in a harbour town, which is an anticlimax."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb28",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms27",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Is Komodo a good honeymoon destination?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb30",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms29",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Komodo works for a honeymoon if you want landscape rather than pampering. The islands are genuinely spectacular and a private boat makes them feel like yours. The trade-off is that Labuan Bajo itself is a functional harbour town, the days start early, and the comfort level is closer to good hotel than luxury resort."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb32",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms31",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Should you charter a private boat or join a shared trip?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb34",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms33",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Charter, if the budget stretches at all. On a shared boat you arrive at Padar and Pink Beach at the same time as everyone else, which is exactly when they are least worth seeing. A private boat lets you go an hour earlier or later, and on a honeymoon that single decision changes the trip more than the room does."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmt35",
      "_type": "comparisonTable",
      "caption": "Prices vary widely by boat and season, so get two or three quotes from licensed operators rather than booking the first one you find.",
      "columns": ["", "Shared day boat", "Private charter"],
      "rows": [
        {
          "_key": "kmr36",
          "cells": [
            "Timing",
            "Fixed, and everyone arrives together",
            "Yours, which is the whole point at Padar"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "kmr37",
          "cells": [
            "Cost",
            "The cheapest way to see the park",
            "Materially more, and the best-value upgrade on this trip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "kmr38",
          "cells": [
            "Feel",
            "Sociable, busy, thirty people on one deck",
            "Quiet, and the reason to do this as a honeymoon"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "kmr39",
          "cells": [
            "Best for",
            "Solo travellers and friends counting costs",
            "Couples, and anyone who wants the ridge without a queue"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb41",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms40",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 1: Fly in and do nothing"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb44",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms42",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms43",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Fly from Bali. The direct flight takes about 1 hour 15 minutes, and it is the only sensible way in."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb47",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms45",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms46",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Settle in, walk the harbour front, meet your boat operator in person if you can."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb50",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms48",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms49",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sunset from a hill bar above the town, which is the one thing Labuan Bajo genuinely does well."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb53",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms51",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Base: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms52",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Labuan Bajo, four nights."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb59",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms55",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Booking logic: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms56",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Flights fill fast in June to September and December, so "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms57",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["kmm54"],
          "text": "compare Bali to Labuan Bajo flights on 12Go"
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms58",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " before you fix anything else. Published fares start around IDR 1.6 million and move a lot with season."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "kmm54",
          "_type": "affiliateLinkRef",
          "placeholderId": "12GO_BALI_LABUAN_BAJO"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb62",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms60",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms61",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Take a morning flight. Afternoon delays are common at this small airport and a late arrival costs you the first evening."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb64",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms63",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 2: The private boat day, and Padar at sunrise"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb67",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms65",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms66",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Leave in the dark for Padar. Being first on the ridge rather than fortieth is the single thing you are paying the charter for."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb70",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms68",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms69",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pink Beach, then a snorkel stop, then Komodo or Rinca for the dragons with a ranger."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb73",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms71",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms72",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Back late and tired. Eat simply."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb76",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms74",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Booking logic: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms75",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Park entry in 2026 uses a single bundled ticket per route, around IDR 650,000 per person for the Komodo Island route or around IDR 900,000 for routes taking in Rinca and Padar, pre-booked through the SiORA app or a licensed operator. Treat these as working figures and confirm when you book, since the system has changed more than once."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb79",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms77",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms78",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The dragons are the least romantic part of the day and the most photographed. Do them, but do not build the day around them."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb81",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms80",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 3: A slow second water day"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb84",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms82",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms83",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Manta Point or Kanawa, depending on conditions. Ask the operator the night before, not a week before."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb87",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms85",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms86",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Swim, read, and stay on the boat rather than rushing back."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb90",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms88",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms89",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Dinner in town."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb93",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms91",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms92",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If day 2 was blown out by weather, this is the day it moves to. That is why the route holds two water days and not one."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb95",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms94",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 4: Off the water"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb98",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms96",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms97",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A slow start. Cunca Wulang waterfall inland, or a spa morning, or nothing at all."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb101",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms99",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms100",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Repack for the island. Anything you do not need can stay in Labuan Bajo."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb104",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms102",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms103",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Last night in town."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb106",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms105",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 5: Move to a quiet island"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb109",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms107",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms108",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Short boat transfer to one of the small resort islands off the coast."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb112",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms110",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms111",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The point of these two nights is that there is nothing to do."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb115",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms113",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Base: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms114",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Island resort, two nights."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb121",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
