    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb137",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms136",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 7: Back to Labuan Bajo and out"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb140",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms138",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms139",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Boat back and fly out. Give yourself a wide margin."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb143",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms141",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms142",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If either of you dived on this trip, leave at least 18 to 24 hours before flying. Plan the last dive for day 5 at the latest."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb145",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms144",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What to book early, and what to keep flexible"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb147",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms146",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Book the flights, the boat charter and the island nights well ahead: all three are capacity-limited and all three get expensive late. Keep the individual island stops flexible, because the operator will know on the morning which order works with the wind. A charter that refuses to adjust the route to conditions is the wrong charter."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb149",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms148",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Mistakes couples make on this route"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb151",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms150",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Booking a shared boat to save money, then spending the honeymoon in a queue. Staying in Labuan Bajo the whole week and wondering why it felt like a logistics exercise. Putting the boat day last, so bad weather has nowhere to move to. And flying out the same day as the final dive, which is both a bad idea and easily avoided."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb153",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms152",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What to cut, adapt or upgrade"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb155",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms154",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Short on time, cut the island stay and run this in five days from Labuan Bajo, accepting that the trip ends in a harbour town. If a charter is out of budget, take a shared boat but pay for the smallest one you can find rather than the cheapest. Upgrading, swap the two island nights for a liveaboard and sleep out among the islands, which is the version most couples wish they had booked."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb157",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms156",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before you build this trip"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb160",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms158",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Money. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms159",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Park fees are bundled per route and paid ahead through the official app or your operator, around IDR 650,000 or IDR 900,000 per person in 2026 depending on the route. Carry cash for everything else, since card payment outside hotels is unreliable."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb163",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms161",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Season. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms162",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The dry months, roughly April to October, bring the calmest seas. January and February are the worst for cancelled boat days."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb166",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms164",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Health. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms165",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The nearest serious medical care is in Bali. Check your insurance covers boat travel and, if relevant, diving."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb172",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms168",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Connectivity. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms169",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Signal drops away as soon as you leave the harbour, and you will want it back when you return. An "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms170",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["kmm167"],
          "text": "Indonesia eSIM with Airalo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "kms171",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " saves hunting for a local SIM on arrival."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "kmm167",
          "_type": "affiliateLinkRef",
          "placeholderId": "AIRALO_INDONESIA"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb174",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms173",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Final verdict"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kmb176",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kms175",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Komodo is not the obvious honeymoon, and that is most of its appeal. Booked as a shared day trip from a harbour hotel it is a mediocre one. Booked as a private boat and two quiet island nights, it is a week of scenery almost nobody else has photographs of, and the money goes into the experience rather than the thread count. If you want to be looked after rather than moved around, go to Lombok and the Gilis instead."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
